<title>FRANCE: Suez has no comment on merger report.</title>
<headline>Suez has no comment on merger report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez on Monday said it had no comment whatsoever on a report in the Sunday Times saying the financial group would announce a merger with Lyonnaise des Eaux in the next few months.</p>
<p>While rumours about a pending merger have been swirling for months, with both companies involved declining to comment, the British paper added that Morgan Stanley was appointed financial adviser to Suez while Bankers Trust was adviser to Lyonnaise.</p>
<p>&quot;We have absolutely no comment,&quot; a spokeswoman for Suez said when asked to comment on the details of the article.  </p>
<p>At Lyonnaise des Eaux there was no immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
